SUMMARY:The Saturday Ashbridges Bay- Walk\, Talk and Make New Friends!
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 \\*Please read carefully\\*\n\nLooking to enjoy the outdoors\, have some g
 reat conversations and meet new people? Join us for a relaxed Saturday wal
 k through beautiful Ashbridges Bay! We’ll take in the waterfront scenery
 \, enjoy the fresh air and create plenty of opportunities to talk\, laugh 
 and make new friends along the way. Come by yourself or bring a friend—e
 ither way\, you’ll receive a warm welcome!\n\n\\*Joined by my other grou
 ps too :)\n\n**Arrive between 4:00 pm and 4:30 pm**\n\n**Where to meet us:
 **\n\nMeetup us outside **Woodbine Station beside bike racks**\n**The Main
  Woodbine Station Entrance:** Located at the southeast corner of Woodbine 
 Avenue and Strathmore Boulevard.\n\nWe will walk as a group from the stati
 on down to Ashbridges Bay\n\\*Most will stick around after for a bite to e
 at\, ice cream and/or a beverage to sip on :)\n\nFurther details below:\n\
 nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\n**Event Details:**\n**
 The Saturday Ashbridges Bay- Walk\, Talk and Make New Friends!**\n\nWhat t
 o expect:\n\n* A relaxed walk along the Ashbridges Bay waterfront\n* Ice b
 reaker games to get to know one another\n* Plenty of opportunities to mix\
 , mingle and meet new people\n* A comfortable pace that allows everyone to
  walk and talk\n* Beautiful views of the lake\, beach\, parkland and surro
 unding area\n* A positive atmosphere for both newcomers and returning memb
 ers\n\nPlease wear comfortable walking shoes and bring water\, sunscreen o
 r anything else you may need for the weather. The purpose of this event is
  simple: get outside\, enjoy the day and make a few new connections!\n\n\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 n**Event Fee:**\n10 dollars (cash only) when you arrive (HST is included)\
 nor e transfer in advance to [Steveflemming11@gmail.com](mailto:Steveflemm
 ing11@gmail.com)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\nParking near Woodbine Station:\n(Although I encourage you
  to take subway if you can)
