 e your ticket in advance with me to get on the guest list-Thank You (Detai
 ls below) 20 dollars via e transfer to Steveflemming11@gmail.com (or you c
 an pay me at an upcoming event\; assuming it has not sold out)\n\nHello ev
 eryone\,\n\nKindly join us for a great Sunday afternoon\; as we mix\, ming
 le\, make new friends and dance the day away with a fabulous **Live Band-T
 he Liverpool Sessions-An awesome Beatles Tribute Band!**\n\n\\*Joined by m
