 event that will sell out\n\nor 30 dollars at the door (with no guarantee s
 eating or even entry as this event will sell out fast)\n\n**-Arrive any ti
 me between 1:30 pm and 2:00 pm inside the restaurant (ask or look for Stev
 e/Organizer when you arrive) (Please try to arrive on time for this event)
 **\n\n(1 minute walk from the new Mt. Pleasant & Eglinton station)
