SUMMARY:The Sunday Night Mix\, Mingle and Dinner Party! (August 30th)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Come join us for the **Sunday Night Mix\, Mingle and Dinner Party** at Smo
 ke Show BBQ & Brew! It’s a relaxed Sunday evening for meeting new people
 \, enjoying some great food and drinks\, and having good conversation in a
  friendly\, welcoming atmosphere. Whether you come on your own or bring a 
 friend\, the idea is simple—get out of the house\, connect with others\,
  share some laughs\, and enjoy a casual night together. No pressure\, no f
 ormal agenda—just good people and a fun Sunday night!\n\n-Reserved seati
 ng\, friendly people\, good conversation and great food awaits!\n\n*\\*Joi
 ned by my other social groups too so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out
 !*\n\n**Date:** Sunday\, August 30th\, 2026\n**Arrival Time:** Please arri
 ve between 6:15 p.m. -7:00 p.m. (if you can)\n**Where to Meet us?**\n**Loc
 ation:** Smoke Show\n**Address:** 744 Mt. Pleasant\n**Free Parking:** in R
 esidential area and on Eglinton and Mt. Pleasant north of Eglinton\n**Egli
 nton and Mt. Pleasant Subway:** (Very close\, 1 minute walking distance)\n
 \nEvent Details Bellow:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)
 \n\nEvent Details:\n**The Sunday Night Mix\, Mingle and Dinner Party!**\n\
 n* Meet and mingle with new and familiar faces\n* Enjoy dinner\, drinks an
 d the atmosphere at Smoke Show BBQ & Brew\n* Come alone or bring a friend
 —everyone is welcome\n* Relax\, laugh and enjoy some genuine conversatio
 n\n* Make new friendships and connections\n* Stay for a little while or sp
 end the evening with us\n\n**Hosted by Steve Flemming — Soul City Social
  Club**\n\n**This is purely optional:**\n**Dinner Party Topics** may inclu
 de but not limited too: Travel\, Culture\, Spirituality\, Relationships\, 
 Modern Dating\, Work/Life balance\, Art\, Technology\, Music\, Movies\, Sp
 orts\, Fashion\, Hobbies\, Books\, Psychology\, Philosophy\, the Future\, 
 History\, Pop Culture\, Theatre\, etc.)\n\\*Or you can just converse casua
 lly and organically :)\n\n**Arrival Time:**\n\\*Join us any time between 6
 :15 pm and 7:00 pm (if you can) for a fun and highly interactive evening a
 s we get to know the members over dinner and great conversations (of your 
 choice)\n\\*Please do not arrive before 6:15 to give people at previous ev
 ent time to leave-much appreciated :)\n\n**Event Fee:**\n5 dollars (cash o
 nly please) (HST included)\nor in advance by e transfer to **[steveflemmin
 g11@gmail.com](http://steveflemming11@gmail.com/)**\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Friendly Reminder:**\n\\*One beverage or appetizer mini
 mum to support the venue- this is greatly appreciated :)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
