SUMMARY:Sunday Night with Friends (Cocktails and Conversations) 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Join us for **Sunday Night with Friends — Cocktails and Conversations**\
 , a relaxed evening of good drinks\, great conversation and new connection
 s. Come on your own or bring a friend and enjoy meeting a welcoming group 
 of people in a casual social atmosphere. There’s no agenda and no pressu
 re—just pull up a chair\, grab your favourite drink and join the convers
 ation.\n\n-Reserved seating\, friendly people\, drink specials and great c
 onversations await!\n\n*\\*Joined by my other social groups too so we can 
 anticipate a fabulous turn out!*\n\n**Date:** Sunday\, August 30th\, 2026\
 n**Arrival Time:** Please arrive between 7:00 p.m. -7:45 p.m. (if you can)
 \n**Where to Meet us?**\n**Location:** Smoke Show\n**Address:** 744 Mt. Pl
 easant\n**Free Parking:** in Residential area and on Eglinton and Mt. Plea
 sant north of Eglinton\n**Eglinton and Mt. Pleasant Subway:** (Very close\
 , 1 minute walking distance)\n\nEvent Details Bellow:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSt
 eve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\n**Event Details:**\n**Sunday Night with 
 Friends (Cocktails and Conversations)**\n\nCome join us for Sunday Night w
 ith Friends — Cocktails and Conversations\, a casual evening designed fo
 r meeting new people\, reconnecting with familiar faces\, sharing some lau
 ghs and enjoying genuinely good conversation. Grab your favourite cocktail
 \, beer\, wine or non-alcoholic drink\, pull up a chair and settle in. The
 re’s no agenda and no pressure—just a friendly group of people enjoyin
 g a Sunday night together. Come on your own or bring a friend\; either way
 \, we’ll do our best to make you feel at home.\n\n* Meet new people and 
 make new friends\n* Enjoy cocktails\, drinks and casual conversation\n* Ca
 tch up with familiar faces\n* Share some stories\, laughs and good company
 \n* Come alone or bring a friend\n* Stay for a drink or spend the evening 
 with us\n\n**Hosted by Steve Flemming — Soul City Social Club**\n\n**Thi
 s is purely optional:**\n**Cocktails and Coversation Topics:**\n\n* Travel
  — favourite destinations\, hidden gems and dream vacations\n* Movies an
 d television — great films\, current shows and old favourites\n* Music 
 — concerts\, favourite artists and songs that bring back memories\n* Foo
 d and restaurants — favourite Toronto spots\, cooking and memorable meal
 s\n* Dating and relationships — modern romance\, attraction and what mak
 es relationships work\n* Life experiences — funny stories\, unexpected a
 dventures and lessons learned along the way\n* Dreams and future plans —
  places you'd like to go\, things you'd still like to experience and what 
 might come next\n\n**Arrival Time:**\n\\*Join us any time between 7:00 pm 
 and 7:45 pm (if you can) for a fun and highly interactive evening as we ge
 t to know the members over dinner and great conversations (of your choice)
 \n\n**Event Fee:**\n5 dollars (cash only please) (HST included)\nor in adv
 ance by e transfer to **[steveflemming11@gmail.com](http://steveflemming11
 @gmail.com/)**\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Friendly Reminder:
 **\n\\*One beverage or appetizer minimum to support the venue- this is gre
 atly appreciated :)\n\\*Dinner Menu will still be available :)\n\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
