SUMMARY:The Saturday Night Long Weekend Dinner and Live Band Bash!
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nGood day everyone\,\
 n\nPlease join us for a great long weekend as we mix\, mingle\, make new f
 riends\, dinner party and dance the night away with a fabulous Live Band!\
 n\n\\*Joined by my other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulo
 us turn out with lots of friendly peers to enjoy dinner and the game\n\n**
 \\*Meet us inside Smoke Show between 6:30 pm and 8:30 pm**\n\\*If you have
  to arrive after that\, still let the front door guy know you are with Ste
 ve's group so he can direct you to us (but kindly do your best to arrive b
 etween 6:30 pm and 8:00 pm (as I can't promise seating after that)-Thank y
 ou!\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/
 Host )\n\nEvent Details:\n**The Saturday Night Long Weekend Dinner and Liv
 e Band Bash!**\n\n-A fun\, interactive\, event with friends\, food\, reser
 ved seating\, Live Band\, DJ and Dancing!\n-Pool Table available\, and Pat
 io too\n-Plenty of parking all around the venue and very close to Mt. Plea
 sant Station\n\n**Event Fee:**\n10 dollars (cash only) when you arrive (HS
 T is included)\nor e transfer in advance to [Steveflemming11@gmail.com](ht
 tp://Steveflemming11@gmail.com/)\n(One Beverage or Appetizer Minimum pleas
 e)\n\n**-Arrive any time between 6:30 pm and 8:30 pm inside the restaurant
  (ask or look for Steve/Organizer when you arrive)**\n\\*If arriving after
  8:30 you still need to let the guy at the front door know you are with St
 eve's group so he can properly direct you to us and help track our numbers
 - Thank you for your kind co-operation!\n\n(1 minute walk from the new Mt.
  Pleasant & Eglinton station)
